<h1><a href='https://pharesst.irsst.qc.ca/cgi/viewcontent.cgi?article=1225&amp;context=rapports-scientifique'>A wind tunnel study of the effect of adjacent buildings on near-field pollutant dispersion from rooftop emissions</a></h1>
</div>
<div class='clear'></div>
<div id='authors' class='element'>
<h2 class='visually-hidden'>Auteurs</h2>
